# Build and Deployment Guide

## Building the Application
The application can be built using Visual Studio or the .NET CLI:

```bash
# Debug build
dotnet build -c Debug

# Release build
dotnet build -c Release
```

## Creating Deployable Executable
To create a self-contained executable for distribution:

```bash
dotnet publish -c Release -r win-x64 --self-contained true -p:PublishSingleFile=true -p:IncludeNativeLibrariesForSelfExtract=true -p:EnableCompressionInSingleFile=true
```

The executable will be created in:
`bin/Release/net8.0-windows/win-x64/publish/DrawingRegister.App.exe`

## Deployment Notes
- The published executable is self-contained and includes all necessary .NET runtime components
- Target platform: Windows 11 (x64)
- No additional installation or .NET runtime required on target machines
- Executable can be run directly by double-clicking

